@Microphunktv-jb3kj takken is most played game in Pakistan in Game arenas. But mostly ots taken 3 or 5....
And every city has 10 shops every shop has his own hero level players and when they come up to meet each other they start rivalry just for one win they practice weeks. Take a example of our city our area player he lost from another city player he took 3 months in practice and went to his city and beat him in takken 3 and Earned his respect back in his area...
Take is like cure for a lot of things in pakistan for gammers. And no we dont have online match making we play on one machine 2 people and whoever wins is win..

